## What belongs here

Terms, and what each one **is**. Implementation detail belongs in the code and technical decisions
belong in ADRs; this file stays worth opening because it holds neither.

Only words a newcomer would not already understand. Timeout, retry and DTO stay out however much the
project uses them; a common word carrying a meaning specific to this project is the most valuable
entry here.
